// Custom 16 — Recursion and closures
// Exercises: recursive functions and mutual recursion (Q19), closures that
//            read and assign captured variables, function factories, a
//            captured local outliving its call, arrays as shared state (Q26),
//            probing an array with `is none` (Q8), string equality (Q5),
//            `not x` / `-x` on bare references (Q4)
//
// Written after the decisions were taken, so unlike the older programs it
// uses the bare prefix forms and lets function bodies see their surroundings.
